  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Earth Voice: Inspiring Shift</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To expand the connection between middle and high school students in underserved communities to the climate justice movement, Earth Guardians&apos; (EG) youth leaders will visit 28+ public schools nationwide to deliver a keynote on the climate crisis, lead students in a hands-on project outdoors, and support each school in starting an EG Crew with ongoing support. Our mission is for our youth mentors to inspire youth agency, community engagement, and positive climate impact in the most affected areas.</narrative>
  </description>
